__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
saves/
*.freesail.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.claude/
# the chart build's fetch cache (tools/build_charts.py): the sources' downloads and the
# period scans, never committed
.cache/
# the harness's saves on an opt-out or a stand-down, written in the working directory
freesail-seed*-tick*.json
day.json
# the chart levels the tool builds and the repository does not carry (spec M5 §10): the
# world at 2.5 minutes and the Atlantic at 30 seconds, tools/build_charts.py --world/--atlantic.
# The corridor at level 1 (spec M6 §26, package 38; tools/build_charts.py --corridor) is the
# one level-1 folder committed, under its own name: the rule for tiles/1/ gives way for it
# alone, and the Atlantic beyond it is still fetched and not committed
data/charts/tiles/0/
data/charts/tiles/1/*
!data/charts/tiles/1/atlantic-corridor/
# package 37d kept three saves as test fixtures (tests/fixtures/saves/): the rule above would
# hide them, so they are let through here
!tests/fixtures/saves/
